    "internet": "Actual bounded donation and separate app UID on consumer with mobile data off: uncached DNS, HTTP, HTTPS and UDP STUN over shared VPN. Negative no-donation control, stop donation and stop consuming passed; mobile data restored.",
    "maps": "Actual offline region download/view/remove only generated region, existing maps preserved. Native Android screencaps used because WebGL CDP screenshot was unreliable.",
    "other": "All five navigation tabs, ten settings categories, available help dialogs, appearance persistence, roster/profile restore, Android settings, runtime diagnostics and reviewed exports, real two-way benchmarks and stop/disarm."
  },
